#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""The Speed block of the Harness doctor, docs/speed-doctor-design.md: every owner minute lost to waiting, as OM/d.

Reads only Harness's derived files (events, speed-days) and the speed journals, by offset, keeps its own state and
journals under ${SPEED_DOCTOR_DIR:-~/.cache/speed-doctor}, and lays its result into Harness's latest.json (own key
`speed`) and the top of its menu.txt through harness-doctor's apply_speed."""

